#!/data/data/com.termux/files/usr/bin/bash
SCRIPT_DIR="$(cd -- "$(dirname -- "$0")" && pwd)"
ROOT="$SCRIPT_DIR"
if [ ! -r "$ROOT/lib/colors.sh" ] && [ -r "$HOME/termux-cyber-downloader/lib/colors.sh" ]; then
  ROOT="$HOME/termux-cyber-downloader"
fi
source "$ROOT/lib/colors.sh"

HELP_WIDTH="$(term_width)"
(( HELP_WIDTH > 4 )) && HELP_WIDTH=$((HELP_WIDTH - 4))
(( HELP_WIDTH < 20 )) && HELP_WIDTH=20

banner "CYBERFORGE HELP"
cat <<'HELP' | fold -s -w "$HELP_WIDTH"
START
  DL / cyberforge            Open the interactive main menu
  DL "https://..."           Open menu with a URL
  cyber-help                 Show this help page

SHARE MENU
  Share a supported link from another Android app to Termux.
  Telegram t.me links are routed to the Telegram downloader.
  Supported file links are automatically downloaded to Documents or APKs.

VIDEO
  Choose a resolution: Best, 2160p, 1440p, 1080p, 720p, 480p, 360p.
  Turbo mode uses yt-dlp -N 8 where the source supports parallel fragments.
  Trim asks for start/end timestamps and the selected resolution.

VIDEO EXTRAS
  Download the selected video together with available English subtitles, or choose
  video-only mode with Best, 2160p, 1440p, 1080p, 720p, 480p, or 360p.

TELEGRAM
  Telegram downloads are saved in Movies/Telegram.
  Choose 1, 2, 4, or 8 transfer threads with the standard tdl package.
  The normal --continue option is used, but an interrupted file may restart.
  After a successful download, optionally create a 1080p, 720p, 480p,
  or 360p FFmpeg copy. The original file is never replaced.

QUEUE
  Queue items run sequentially. Failed or cancelled URLs remain in
  data/download_queue.txt. Edit the queue from the menu or with nano.

PLAYLISTS
  Before each playlist download, enter a folder name. The playlist is saved
  in Movies/<folder name>/ with numbered filenames. Reuse the same folder
  name when retrying an interrupted playlist download.

DOCUMENT MANAGER
  Menu option 12 opens the Document Manager.
  Find local files by filename or search by type (PDF, Word/text, spreadsheets,
  presentations, images, archives, audio, video, APK, or a custom extension) in
  accessible internal shared storage and detected SD/USB/removable volumes.
  Storage locations are checked and labelled read/write or read only.
  Select multiple results with indexes (1 35 74), commas, or ranges (1-5).
  Choose Copy, Move, Delete, Read/Open, or Convert when supported files are selected. Delete requires typing DELETE to confirm.
  Remove private metadata creates a separate copy in Documents/PrivacyCleaned; the original is never changed. Supported: common images, PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, ODT and EPUB. PDF needs ExifTool; images use ExifTool or ImageMagick.
  Choose Check metadata to inspect selected supported files for common privacy-sensitive tags. ExifTool is required: pkg install exiftool. CyberForge also checks a cleaned copy automatically when ExifTool is installed. A clean result is not a guarantee that every vendor-specific tag or visible personal detail is gone.
  Copy/move supports destination folders on storage locations Termux can access.
  Name collisions can be skipped, auto-renamed to keep both, or replaced after
  a separate confirmation. Move verifies the copied bytes before deleting source.
  Search and inspection do not modify original files.
  Convert supported DOCX, ODT, EPUB, HTML, Markdown, TXT and RTF files with
  Pandoc; selectable-text PDF extraction needs Poppler; image conversion needs
  ImageMagick. Image formats exclude the source format from target choices.
  CSV <-> XLSX conversion uses openpyxl. LibreOffice (libreoffice/soffice), when
  installed, enables XLS/XLSX/ODS spreadsheet and PPT/PPTX/ODP/PDF conversions.
  Without LibreOffice, PPTX slide text can be exported to TXT using Python's built-in ZIP/XML libraries (no python-pptx or lxml required). This extracts slide text only, not layout, images, animations, or notes.
  XLSX-to-CSV exports one selected worksheet and formula expressions; CSV cannot preserve workbook formatting, charts, or multiple sheets.
  Images can also be converted to PDF. Document-to-PDF needs Pandoc plus a PDF
  engine such as Tectonic, XeLaTeX, LuaLaTeX, or WeasyPrint. Scanned PDFs are
  not OCR'd.
  Read/Open is offered only when exactly one file is selected. It previews text
  in the terminal, extracts selectable PDF text, or opens media with Termux:API.
  After document, spreadsheet, presentation, or image conversion, choose
  Documents/Converted or a detected writable SD card / USB drive. This same
  destination choice applies to converted images too. Removable copies go under
  CyberForge/Converted. A volume is offered only when Termux can read and write
  it. Originals are never modified.
  Copy/move destinations are limited to locations that pass a write-access test.
  Download a document or archive from a URL using the download option.
  OCR and document-content search are not included.

APK DOWNLOAD
  Direct APK URLs, APKPure, and F-Droid options are available.
  The old local APK scanner has been removed. Verify packages before installing.

NETWORK SHORTCUT
  Menu option 13 opens Android Radio Information.
  Choose LTE only for a 4G lock; restore Auto or LTE/WCDMA if calls or
  mobile service are affected. The general Android control panel is removed.

TOOL UPDATE CENTER
  Menu option 14 updates Termux packages, yt-dlp, optional Python media tools,
  displays versions, and checks which packages have updates available.
  Use the update check to see pending updates.

MOVIE / SERIES
  Search Google, JustWatch, or IMDb for legitimate sources.
  Paste a source URL only when downloading is permitted by that source.
  Choose a resolution and thread count before the yt-dlp download.

IMAGE & MEDIA TOOLS
  Download direct image URLs or social/gallery posts (gallery-dl required
  for supported gallery sites), save video thumbnails, and process local
  or downloaded images into crops, compressed formats, Expo assets, Web/PWA
  assets, or a PDF.

DEPENDENCIES
  pkg install git python ffmpeg termux-api nano curl tdl
  pip install -U yt-dlp
  Optional image tools: pip install -U gallery-dl pillow
  Optional document conversion: pkg install pandoc poppler
  Spreadsheet CSV/XLSX: python -m pip install -U openpyxl
  Optional image conversion: pkg install imagemagick
  PDF metadata removal: pkg install exiftool
  Install apkeep separately if you use APK source features.

INPUT VALIDATION
  Invalid menu choices and validated inputs show a clear error and allow up to
  three attempts. After the third invalid attempt, the current operation returns
  to its previous menu. Yes/no confirmation prompts keep their normal behavior.

DISPLAY COMPATIBILITY
  The interface detects terminal width and uses a safe fallback when terminal
  size tools are unavailable. Narrow screens use compact, single-column menus.
HELP
